<title>USA: Vitronics president, COO Lawler resigns.</title>
<headline>Vitronics president, COO Lawler resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEWMARKET, N.H. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitronics Corp said on Wednesday that its president and chief operating officer, Ronald Lawler, resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>James Manfield, the company's chairman and chief executive, was named president.</p>
<p>Vitronics makes thermal processing equipment.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
